1,"_192":193},"itemId","fvrqffd9ourqoe70wou50cp6c","意大利伪造政府应用利用 Morpheus 间谍软件监控寻求庇护者","IrpiMedia 调查称，意大利内政部标识的 Android 应用 FirmaDigitale 伪装成庇护者保护状态通知，实际投递 Morpheus 间谍软件。","sourceName","Security Affairs","sourceUrl","https://securityaffairs.com/204142/intelligence/fake-government-app-exposes-italys-expanding-spyware-surveillance-industry.html","publishedAt","2026-11-28T00:08:30.000Z","sourceIconUrl","/dailyinfo/media/ef2b2b57fb06e54f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet","/dailyinfo/media/2adef5b1e4357a03.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/ef2b2b57fb06e54f.webp 96w","firstParty",false,"available",true,"漏洞与在野利用",[196],{"_176":150,"_57":141,"_172":197,"_180":198,"_182":199,"_184":200,"_186":-5,"_190":193,"_192":193},"Ubuntu 发布 Apache HTTP Server 安全更新，修复 CVE-2026-46729、CVE-2026-47360、CVE-2026-48005、CVE-2026-56153、CVE-2026-56449、CVE-2026-56154、CVE-2026-57941、CVE-2026-59797、CVE-2026-58415、CVE-2026-63045、CVE-2026-63292、CVE-2026-63686、CVE-2026-63718、CVE-2026-73636、CVE-2026-73637、CVE-2026-79768 和 CVE-2026-93546，涉及拒绝服务、任意代码执行、敏感信息泄露、认证绕过及 HTTP 响应走私等风险。受影响版本覆盖 Ubuntu 14.04 LTS、16.04 LTS、18.04 LTS、20.04 LTS、22.04 LTS、24.04 LTS、26.04 LTS 和 26.10，部分漏洞仅影响 Ubuntu 26.10。USN-9016-1 的上游修复还引入在特定情况下阻止重定向设置 Cookie 的回归问题，本次更新一并修复。","Ubuntu 安全公告","https://ubuntu.com/security/notices/USN-9016-2","2026-11-26T22:34:55.000Z",{"_176":177,"_57":178,"_172":179,"_180":181,"_182":183,"_184":185,"_186":187,"_188":189,"_190":191,"_192":193},"leadParagraph",{"_204":205,"_206":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
